    aiContent: {
      difficulty: 'Intermediate',
      considerations: [
        'Reach a cumulative score of +11 or more, or -11 or less, over multiple hands. Each hand, score +1 per trick over your quota of 4, -1 per trick under 4; exactly 4 tricks scores 0.',
        'Clubs are always trumps. Follow suit if possible; if possible you must play a card that beats the highest card so far in the trick. You may not lead a club until clubs are broken or you have only clubs. Trick won by highest club in it, or if no club by highest card of the suit led. Winner of each trick leads to the next.',
        'Follow suit if possible. Must beat the current highest card in the trick if possible. Cannot lead a club until clubs are broken or you hold only clubs. Quota is 4 tricks per player per hand.',
      ],
